* {{audio|De-Hackfresse.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Hackfressen}}

# {{lb|de|vulgar}} very derisive term for a person that is perceived as ugly, comparable to [[shitface]]
#: ''schau dir mal die Hackfresse an''

